<title>NETHERLANDS: Shares in ASM Litho skyrocket.</title>
<headline>Shares in ASM Litho skyrocket.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in semiconductor equipment maker ASM Lithography rocketed almost 16 percent or 21.50 guilders to 156.50 guilders on Monday and dealers said the whole technology sector was in favour of investors.</p>
<p>&quot;The market seems to be more positive about technology stocks at the moment,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>But, he added there was no obvious reason for ASM Lithography to outperform the market so much.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
